<title>SINGAPORE: Keppel Land buys site for S$14 mln.</title>
<headline>Keppel Land buys site for S$14 mln.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Keppel Land Ltd said on Tuesday it has agreed to buy a Singapore site from Keppel Corporation Ltd for Singapore $14 million.</p>
<p>The 3,923 sq m site is in the eastern part of Singapore. It comprises a 3,654 sq m freehold lot and a 269 sq m lot with 887 years remaining on the lease, a Keppel Land said in a statement.</p>
<p>It said the site, which contains a holiday bungalow, could be redeveloped to 40 apartments, but plans had not been finalised.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
